[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "text": "Batt!!!!"
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "There you are!!"
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "Travis."
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "Took you long enough."
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "Thought the suspense was gonna kill me!"
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "How will he make his entrance?  "
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "Is he emo or grunge?"
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "What's his fighting style?  "
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "How's his broke-ass face "
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "gonna look when he dies?"
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": "So much hostility."
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "Why?! "
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "Why'd you kill him?!"
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "Ironic question,"
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "coming from an assassin!"
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "Did you honestly think "
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "you could take so many lives "
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "and never suffer retribution? "
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "Have you never even seen a kung fu "
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "movie, spy flick, or Western? "
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "Shakespeare, for god's sake?"
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "If you wanted revenge,"
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": "you should've come for me!"
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "text": "Not only did you murder my father..."
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "text": "But my two brothers as well."
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "text": "That is why I took your"
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "text": "best friend's life."
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "text": "Make sense, Travis?"
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "text": "It's called poetic justice."
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "text": "Go to hell! "
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "text": "Don't ever compare Bishop"
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "text": "with your shithead family!"
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "text": "So naive, Travis."
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "text": "If you have someone to protect, "
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "text": "you will lose them eventually."
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "text": "See for yourself. "
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "text": "Now you're feeling it..."
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "text": "That's your life losing all meaning."
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "text": "You've got nothing left except "
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "text": "this fight."
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "text": "Now I know you'll put all "
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "text": "you have into this."
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "text": "You're gonna fucking pay."
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "text": "A fight to the death."
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "text": "Get angry."
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "text": "So angry you start convulsing."
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "text": "Now draw your katana!!"
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "text": "I'll relish every moment--"
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "text": "every second of this kill."
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "text": "May you savor your death as well."
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "text": "Enough!!!!!!!!!!!!"
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "text": "Let the final battle, BEGIN!!!"
  }
]